bfd8fa953e1b323","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"bladeless hilt","source_tag":"_t","target":"无刃剑柄"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"303ae7a3d3f7e7c430d399e56677c9a5a7b0d33ae61500179a02d91a516d8d93","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"157e7ff0211f6df9a0f81580c1301ddd23c48c279b91c5558f00862ff9e3862e","logical_entry_identity":"81874f15866ad5652657b105aa395d0bc91d8f921d2db5802b7a48a23825051e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"These new effects are #GOLD#cross-tier effects#WHITE#. They occur when a talent calls for comparing #GOLD#combat stats#WHITE# that aren't in the same tier. \n\nPhysical effects cause the \"Off-balance\" effect.\n\nMagic effects cause the \"Spellshocked\" effect.\n\nMental effects cause the \"Brainlocked\" effect.\n\nThe effects last one turn per tier difference in the attacker's and defender's #GOLD#combat stats#WHITE#. For example, casting Mana Gale with a #8d55ff#Tier 5#WHITE# #LIGHT_GREEN#Spellpower#WHITE# on a target with a #B4B4B4#Tier 1#WHITE# #LIGHT_GREEN#Physical save#WHITE# would result in applying a four-turn \"Off-balance\" effect.\n\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"这些新效果是 #GOLD#越层效果#WHITE#。当一个技能需要比较处于不同层级的 #GOLD#战斗属性#WHITE# 时，就会出现它们。\n\n物理效果造成 \"失去平衡\" 效果。\n\n魔法效果造成 \"法术冲击\" 效果。\n\n精神效果造成 \"思维封锁\" 效果。\n\n这些效果的持续时间会随攻击者和防御者的 #GOLD#战斗属性#WHITE# 每相差一个层级增加 1 回合。\n例如，以 #8d55ff#层级 5#WHITE# #LIGHT_GREEN#法术强度#WHITE# 对一个 #B4B4B4#层级 1#WHITE# #LIGHT_GREEN#物理豁免#WHITE#的目标施放法力风暴，会施加持续 4 回合的“失去平衡”效果。\n\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bda7abd8d19100200161bdd309ac1bee730e1e6472ad79d723bddd741ee2c6ce","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"157e85940b1e4289b2b2e3580420b82450d9a4d17abc5d352a3b00d31e700219","logical_entry_identity":"6339d51820a18531507b476b5932f510a8b8106a01d9fe183e2635e5c374e47f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Left mouse to show quest log.\nRight mouse to show all known lore.","source_tag":"_t","target":"左键点击显示任务日志\n右键点击显示所有已知手札。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"521775f01c27c7f7b1